+# TLS Verification Policy
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, and this applies going forward. Local and development testing that needs a TLS endpoint uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. Plain http to internal hosts behind the firewall is acceptable, but any TLS connection keeps certificate verification on.
